  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICTJ Program in South Sudan 2022-2027: Supporting peace-building and justice initiatives in South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program contributes to the following outcomes: 

Outcome 1: South Sudanese government, regional and international policymakers as well as civil society, religious and community leaders have increased knowledge of relevant comparative experiences to consult on, design and implement transitional justice initiatives

Outcome 2: The perspectives, expectations and needs of South Sudanese citizens including those who have been displaced or are refugees are known and inform transitional justice policymaking</narrative>
  </description>
